========================================
DISPATCHARR v0.31.0 COMPLETE BUGFIX PATCH
========================================

This patch combines THREE critical bugfixes for v0.31.0:

1. ✅ Multi-Profile Failover Fix (url_utils.py)
2. ✅ Manual Stream Switch - No Cooldown (manager.py)
3. ✅ Cooldown per Stream+Profile (manager.py)

All three fixes are included and work together seamlessly.

========================================
SUMMARY OF FIXES
========================================

FIX 1: MULTI-PROFILE FAILOVER
------------------------------
Problem: Only 1 profile per provider tried during failover
Root Cause: order_alternates_from_current() used dict that overwrites multiple profiles
Solution: Changed to list-based grouping to preserve ALL profiles per stream

FIX 2: MANUAL STREAM SWITCH - NO COOLDOWN
------------------------------------------
Problem: Manual stream switches set cooldown on previous stream
Root Cause: _close_connection() always set cooldown, even for user actions
Solution: Added _manual_switch flag to skip cooldown on manual switches

FIX 3: COOLDOWN PER STREAM+PROFILE
-----------------------------------
Status: Already correctly implemented in v0.30.0 ✅
Redis Key: live:channel:{channel_id}:stream:{stream_id}:profile:{profile_id}:cooldown
Scope: Per channel + stream + profile (not global)

========================================
FILES CHANGED
========================================

1. apps/proxy/live_proxy/url_utils.py
   - order_alternates_from_current() - preserve all profiles

2. apps/proxy/live_proxy/input/manager.py
   - _manual_switch flag in change_stream_url()
   - Skip cooldown when _manual_switch is True
   - _set_stream_cooldown() already uses per-profile keys

